  "question": {
    "text": "Determine the work done by an ideal gas undergoing a cyclic process from&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>→</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mo>→</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mo>→</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mo>→</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </math>. Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Pa</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Pa</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Pa</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math>.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0158_031b381851cd.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 177px;\" />"
